<p>Shawn,</p>

<p><%= @name %>, a prospective client, has requested more information about signing up on Sanction Search.</p>

<p>
  <% if @company_name.present? %>
      Their company is called "<%= @company_name %>".
  <% end %>
  <% if @employees.present? %>
      They estimate they should have about <%= @employees %> employees.
  <% end %>
</p>

<% if @email.present? %>
    <p>You can follow-up with them by email at: <%= mail_to @email %>.</p>
<% end %>

<% if @phone.present? %>
    <p>You can reach them by phone at <%= link_to @phone, "tel:#{@phone}" %>.</p>
<% end %>